                "text": "Virginian Summer Barrow died of a fentanyl overdose in 2020. \n\nLast month, @POTUS signed into law my bipartisan bill \u2014 the Summer Barrow Prevention, Treatment, and Recovery Act \u2014 to combat addiction and prevent future tragedies in our communities. \n\nhttps://t.co/gDpKnJ2fXB",
