                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "To stop fentanyl overdoses, Democrats and Republicans need to work together to secure our borders AND boost support for treatment & recovery programs. \n\nLast month, @POTUS signed into law my bipartisan bill to strengthen fentanyl detection, as well as my bill to combat addiction.",
