                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "In December, @POTUS signed my bipartisan bill into law to help border personnel intercept illicit fentanyl \u2014 as well as my bill to increase support for prevention, treatment, and recovery programs. \n\nWe can do both. We need an all-out strategy to destroy the threat of fentanyl.",
